━━━ stdout
Show details for one skill from the catalogue.

Usage: opentide setup skills show [OPTIONS] <name>

Arguments:
  <name>
          Skill slug or name

Options:
  -C, --path <PATH>
          Repository path
          
          [default: .]

      --refresh
          Fetch the catalogue again, not the in-process copy of the last 30s

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide setup skills show <slug>

━━━ stderr · empty
